  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia Voz Regional Depots</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a sovereign-guaranteed loan of up to &#x20ac; 25 million to Serbia Voz,  the state-owned railway passenger operator of Serbia.  The proceeds of the loan will be used to finance the rehabilitation and  upgrade of two regional depots and the construction of a new regional depot  (used for the maintenance of the Company&apos;s rolling stock), as well as the  acquisition of new maintenance equipment and supervision.  The Project aims to improve the Company&apos;s maintenance capacity to support the  growth of its rolling stock, as well as to increase the efficiency of passenger  services through improved maintenance practices and to generate energy savings  through energy efficiency measures.</narrative>
  </description>
